<page>
<notes>Max suffix lemma: w is a proper suffix of z and z prime is its greatest contained codeword. Left: a non-empty Y prefix of b starts with e, extending z prime to z prime e. Right: b=x_k, giving a suffix with two decreasing Z factors.</notes>
